    <item>
      <title>Tutorial: Create custom TechDraw Templates.</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/tutorial-create-custom-techdraw-templates/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 19 Dec 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/tutorial-create-custom-techdraw-templates/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The Technical Drawing or &lt;a href=&#34;https://wiki.freecad.org/TechDraw_Workbench&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;TechDraw workbench&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is an integral part of FreeCAD allowing us to create beautiful technical drawings of our parts or assemblies. In a world of CNC milling and 3D printing it&amp;rsquo;s still essential at times to be able to supply someone with a technical drawing to help plan the making of a part. A technical drawing can also be extremely useful as part of documentation and could form part of a technical standard for a project or product, so it&amp;rsquo;s important to be able to create technical drawings that meet our needs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Coming Soon: TechDraw ComplexSection</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/coming-soon-techdraw-complexsection/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 09 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/coming-soon-techdraw-complexsection/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;After &lt;a href=&#34;https://forum.freecadweb.org/viewtopic.php?f=35&amp;amp;t=72026&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;many person-hours of effort&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, last week a new type of section view, &lt;a href=&#34;https://wiki.freecadweb.org/TechDraw_ComplexSection&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;Complex Section&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, was added to the TechDraw workbench. This new type of section allows essentially arbitrary cross-sections to be extracted from 3D geometry and displayed in TechDraw by specifying a specific object as the &amp;ldquo;profile object&amp;rdquo; to use.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
